<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $49 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS OPENS AT $49 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADS opened unchanged at $49 in New York on Friday, and continued higher to $49-1/4 in early trade. The price corresponds to about 224.56 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
